90| *   (default: 30 minutes). Vitest setups mint isolated roots per worker and
91| *   agents mint per-attempt deploy/stage/survey/recon dirs; on long-running
92| *   servers with memory-backed tmpfs, the tens of thousands of accumulated
93| *   roots otherwise exhaust inodes and eat gigabytes of RAM during CI
